  "description": "The Batch 20” Kids Bike is built for bigger adventures and growing confidence. Featuring a lightweight yet durable 6061 aluminum frame, this bike is easy for kids to handle, making each ride smoother and more fun. Designed for both comfort and control, it includes an adjustable padded seat and BMX-style handlebars to provide the perfect fit as young riders grow.\nSafety is a top priority, which is why this bike features both a rear coaster brake for backpedal stopping and a rear linear-pull hand brake for added control. Sturdy aluminum wheels and durable street tires ensure a smooth and stable ride on a variety of surfaces, from sidewalks to bike paths. With a kickstand for easy parking and a handlebar pad for extra protection, the Batch 20” Kids Bike is ready for every adventure. Available in bold colors like Aurora Grey, Lava Red, and Black, this is a ride that looks as good as it performs.",
